border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/03 a 14\/05\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">7CUT Kids (6-15 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 de Maio de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 87m \/ 145m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/03 a 14\/05\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o 7 Cidades Ultimate Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 6\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do 7 Cidades Ultimate Trail (7CUT) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 22 de maio de 2027, com partida e chegada no Parque de Campismo das Sete Cidades, em Ponta Delgada (Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel, A\u00e7ores).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 composto por cinco provas: 7CUT40 (41,8 km | 2432m D+ | partida \u00e0s 07:00), 7CUT20 (25,3 km | 1431m D+ | partida \u00e0s 08:30), 7CUT10 (9,3 km | 642m D+ | partida \u00e0s 09:30), 7CUT Caminhada (8,4 km | 208m D+ | partida \u00e0s 10:00) e 7CUT Kids (2 km a 3,7 km | 87m a 145m D+ | partida \u00e0s 10:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do 7 Cidades Ultimate Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 1 de novembro de 2026 a 14 de maio de 2027 em 3 fases (at\u00e9 31\/12\/2026, at\u00e9 28\/02\/2027 e at\u00e9 14\/05\/2027): 7CUT40 (25\u20ac \/ 30\u20ac \/ 35\u20ac), 7CUT20 (15\u20ac \/ 20\u20ac \/ 30\u20ac), 7CUT10 e Caminhada (10\u20ac \/ 15\u20ac \/ 20\u20ac) e 7CUT Kids (5\u20ac \/ 10\u20ac \/ 10\u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios funciona o secretariado para levantar o peitoral?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona na sexta-feira, 21 de maio de 2027, das 14:00 \u00e0s 19:00 no Stand Autom\u00f3vel Dion\u00edsio Carreiro, LDA (Ponta Delgada), e no s\u00e1bado, 22 de maio, das 06:30 \u00e0s 09:45 no Parque de Campismo das Sete Cidades.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os tempos limite, postos de abastecimento e material obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite \u00e9 de 8 horas no 7CUT40 (com abastecimentos na Cumeeira Grande aos 14,7 km, Aqueduto das 9 Janelas aos 23,6 km e Lagoa do Can\u00e1rio aos 31,8 km), 5h30 no 7CUT20 (Cumeeira Grande e Lagoa do Can\u00e1rio) e 4h30 no 7CUT10. No 7CUT40 e 7CUT20 \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar frontal\/lanterna, telem\u00f3vel, apito, manta de sobreviv\u00eancia, peitoral vis\u00edvel e reservat\u00f3rio m\u00ednimo de 0,5 L.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"7 Cidades Ultimate Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-05-22\", \"endDate\": \"2027-05-22\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Ponta Delgada, A\u00e7ores\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Ponta Delgada\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 7 Cidades Ultimate Trail 2027 realiza-se a 22 de maio em Ponta Delgada, A\u00e7ores. Provas de 42 km, 25 km, 9 km, caminhada e kids. Garante j\u00e1 o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-cidades-ultimate-trail.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"7CUT40 (Trail Longo)\", \"price\": \"25.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR